      "contentPreview": "Deferred behaviour change, deliberately not made during the server drop: \u0060MaintenanceEventSink\u0060 clears the orphan marker in TWO \u0060TryUpdateEntry\u0060 calls (attribute first, then the legacy \u0060orphan\u0060 keyword). The split existed only because the server\u0027s PATCH refused a body that changed Keywords, so bundling them made it refuse BOTH and leave a non-orphan marked \u0060orphan:true\u0060 forever.  With one store both carriers live in the same sidecar, so one mutation could clear them together, atomically, for one",
