      "contentPreview": "Third deferral, queued with the other two for the end of this scope: \u0060IMemoryStore.ListScoped\u0060\u0027s completeness contract (\u0022an implementation backed by a paged source must page to exhaustion; returning one page is a WRONG answer, and a silent one\u0022) is now held by nothing. \u0060PagedListingConformanceTests\u0060 drove it through the remote store and was deleted with it. The surviving FileMemoryStore reads a directory, which cannot page, so there is no live defect \u2014 but four default interface implementations",
